  **No `isBookmarked`/bookmark-state field exists yet.** A new field (likely an enum: idle/saving/saved/error per the prototype doc, see below) would need to be added to this class and its `copyWith`/`==`/`hashCode`/`toString`.

  **`ChatReady`** (chat_state.dart:41-112):
  ```dart
