  Each takes `{required String message}`. `retryable` getter (lines 45-61) is `true` for exactly 6: `NetworkTimeout`, `NetworkOffline`, `PiiCheckFailed`, `EmbeddingFailed`, `AiGenerationTimeout`, `RateLimited`; `false` for the other 8 (including `MalformedResponse`). `Failure.fromCode(code, message)` factory (lines 67-83) maps backend string codes 1:1 to the 13 server subtypes, with an unrecognized code falling back to `malformedResponse`.

